03:39:47.100 --> 03:39:52.070
drained away from the oil. The chicken goes onto a cutting board where it's sliced into bite-sized

03:39:52.070 --> 03:39:58.080
pieces, then onto a serving plate, at which point the lemon sauce goes on top. Lemon sauce is

03:39:58.080 --> 03:39:59.900
actually a very simple mixture.

