03:53:05.800 --> 03:53:11.240
they're actually five different harvest periods but the best leaves are taken from the plants

03:53:11.240 --> 03:53:16.720
during the spring and early winter tea to the chinese is very much like wine to the french

03:53:16.720 --> 03:53:23.370
very serious stuff they want to know what variety of bush was used where on the island it was planted

03:53:23.370 --> 03:53:29.520
what time of year was the leaf plucked how long was the leaf allowed to dry in the sun after harvest

03:53:30.090 --> 03:53:31.690
