03:54:11.650 --> 03:54:16.090
There are tea houses in the countryside and throughout the major metropolitan areas.

03:54:16.550 --> 03:54:22.660
They've become a sanctuary for people looking for a quiet place to sit and talk, to relax and find

03:54:22.660 --> 03:54:29.600
their psychic center. Taiwan specializes in three types of tea leaves. The first is called green tea.

03:54:30.220 --> 03:54:36.080
It's not been fermented at all, and the tea that results is very light in color with a delicate flavor.

03:54:36.900 --> 03:54:41.100
Semi-fermented tea has a slightly dark color and a more robust flavor.

03:54:41.840 --> 03:54:46.460
The tea normally drunk in North America and Europe is 100% fermented tea.

03:54:47.190 --> 03:54:50.090
Here in Asia, it is called red tea or black tea,

03:54:50.230 --> 03:54:55.270
and it produces the deep color and stronger taste that is associated with tea in the West.

